# Thornwood's thorn burrow (CIPlay thornwood_cave, 11-12 w15 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe: the
# new knoll hw_mount at 82 -15 (b 14, h 16) with bamboo on top; kit_dig mouth at 68 -15 (yaw 90: way in = +x), 3 m level,
# 10 m on, a chamber at the end (81..87); the sign twthornsign at 61 -19; a rat (twrat) and a hyena (twhyena) inside; zone
# tw_thorn at 77 -15. Floor 3.52 (the shelf; a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Thornwood keep
hour 11
weather Calm

picture tw_thorn_out 59 +3 -15 68 +1.5 -15
read explorer's tag

# The burrow's animals (11-12 mixed monsters): a rat and a hyena, both inside
wait 3
expect animalsinside Rat 1
expect animalsinside Hyena 1
kill Rat
kill Hyena
expect animals Rat 0
expect animals Hyena 0

walk 62 -17 to 68 -15 to 71 -15 to 77 -15
zone tw_thorn
picture tw_thorn_in 73 +2.5 -15 84 +0.5 -15 light=20
walk 77 -15 to 71 -15 to 68 -15 to 62 -17
